# paint.type AI Manifest (Level 2)

This is the AI manifest for the `docs/governance/` directory (Level 2) of paint.type.

## Purpose

This manifest describes the purpose and structure of the `docs/governance/` directory.

## Authority Split

- **Central protocol authority:** `standards/` repository
- **Local integration authority (this directory):** docs/governance/ specific configurations

## Subdirectories

| Directory | Layer | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `audit/` | 3 | |
| `maintenance/` | 3 | |
| `planning/` | 3 | |

## Canonical Files

- `CRG-CRITERIA.a2ml` -- A2ML machine-readable metadata
- `SOFTWARE-DEVELOPMENT-APPROACH.adoc` -- AsciiDoc documentation
- `MAINTENANCE-CHECKLIST.adoc` -- AsciiDoc documentation
- `CRG-CRITERIA.adoc` -- AsciiDoc documentation
- `SOFTWARE-DEVELOPMENT-APPROACH.a2ml` -- A2ML machine-readable metadata
- `0.1-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml` -- A2ML machine-readable metadata
- `MAINTENANCE-CHECKLIST.a2ml` -- A2ML machine-readable metadata
- `TSDM.a2ml` -- A2ML machine-readable metadata
- `TSDM.adoc` -- AsciiDoc documentation

## Invariants

1. All A2ML state files must live in `.machine_readable/` ONLY, never in the repo root.
2. Each directory at layer 2 must have its own `0.2-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml`.
3. Each directory must have a `README.adoc` describing purpose, contents, and function.
4. SPDX license identifiers must be consistent across all files (AGPL-3.0-or-later).

## Startup Checklist for Agents

1. Read this file (`0.2-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml`).
2. Read `README.adoc` for directory overview.
3. For subdirectories, navigate to their respective manifest files.
4. Never edit `.machine_readable/` files directly.
